  "body_text": "基本信息\n国家：埃塞俄比亚 Ethiopia\n产区: 南部部族州-盖迪奥-耶加雪菲-科克 Koke, Yirgacheffe, Gedeo, SNNPR\n庄园/处理厂：科克莎拉耶 Koke Shalaye\n品种：原生种 Heirloom\n海拔：1900 - 2050 米\n处理方式：超级日晒 Super Natural\n烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n风味：\n青柑普洱、西瓜、柑橘、红色莓果、果汁感\nGreen Mandarin Pu'er tea-like, Watermelon, Citrus, Red berries, Juicy\n关于Koke Shalaye\nKoke Shalaye位于耶加雪菲小镇的Koke村，处理站位于海拔1973米，处理站服务周边近2000户小农；这款超级日晒的处理方式是由世界咖啡师冠军，来自澳洲ONA咖啡的Sasa领军的Project Origin生豆项目在埃塞、肯尼亚开拓的一种“有氧+厌氧”结合的一种发酵方式，从查到的资料里推测应该是咖啡鲜果采收后，在一个并非完全封闭的环境，允许以定量的氧气通量，同时遮光的条件下进行静置发酵。\n我们现在在售的有3款埃塞的偏发酵感的厌氧日晒，分别是Bench Maji Wine Nautral，Shakisso厌氧日晒与这款Koke的超级日晒，3款有的发酵感、莓果感、果汁感上各有千秋，这种类型的处理方式在埃塞已经逐渐的普及起来了，但由于各地的小品种、发酵的环境方式以及时长有所差异所以出来的风味调性也有不同。\n希望大家喜欢！我是猴喜欢滴！\n更多豆豆，关注淘宝与有赞小程序哈~",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SzAPZmDToyWicYBiatibfYicnYHAUwOlibibXxP2M4s5dFuUOzz1YoSv4wYRyWytP2HW85PUWllXwcrrkw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           基本信息\n          </strong>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-right: 0px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);border-bottom: 0px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);border-left: 0px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);border-top-style: solid;border-top-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          国家：埃塞俄比亚 Ethiopia\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          产区: 南部部族州-盖迪奥-耶加雪菲-科克 Koke, Yirgacheffe, Gedeo, SNNPR\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          庄园/处理厂：科克莎拉耶 Koke Shalaye\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          品种：原生种 Heirloom\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          海拔：1900 - 2050 米\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          处理方式：超级日晒 Super Natural\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          青柑普洱、西瓜、柑橘、红色莓果、果汁感\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          Green Mandarin Pu'er tea-like, Watermelon, Citrus, Red berries, Juicy\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SMwshHvmLuFt95wOa4ykO2biaEQwLeobWZz5njtWWJ7tzuwicwjzvedd5bQgXlkbELLjlnukk5AOKA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TLQvzsbN9k3qsnfbqq9YkkibLQ4NED3vmNibKZS2ol4HcCq7mxEUR0egkhhq7uZIn6vficObjd3iaribA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           关于Koke Shalaye\n          </strong>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          Koke Shalaye位于耶加雪菲小镇的Koke村，处理站位于海拔1973米，处理站服务周边近2000户小农；这款超级日晒的处理方式是由世界咖啡师冠军，来自澳洲ONA咖啡的Sasa领军的Project Origin生豆项目在埃塞、肯尼亚开拓的一种“有氧+厌氧”结合的一种发酵方式，从查到的资料里推测应该是咖啡鲜果采收后，在一个并非完全封闭的环境，允许以定量的氧气通量，同时遮光的条件下进行静置发酵。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: normal;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          我们现在在售的有3款埃塞的偏发酵感的厌氧日晒，分别是Bench Maji Wine Nautral，Shakisso厌氧日晒与这款Koke的超级日晒，3款有的发酵感、莓果感、果汁感上各有千秋，这种类型的处理方式在埃塞已经逐渐的普及起来了，但由于各地的小品种、发酵的环境方式以及时长有所差异所以出来的风味调性也有不同。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SzAPZmDToyWicYBiatibfYicnYatNbutqaN4AFtAoR245wwkzRuZ1ibB2wvdibxwA55rKfajib7oNMN3tXg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          希望大家喜欢！我是猴喜欢滴！\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多豆豆，关注淘宝与有赞小程序哈~\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-typ